writer-local
============

Original work (MIT). The "pattern = one Markdown file with a system prompt" idea follows
danielmiessler/Fabric (https://github.com/danielmiessler/Fabric, MIT); no Fabric code or
pattern text is included — all patterns here are written in Korean for public-institution use.

LLM (not bundled): called via an OpenAI-compatible API; default deployment is Ollama (https://github.com/ollama/ollama, MIT)
  serving Google Gemma (gemma4:31b, https://ai.google.dev/gemma — see Gemma's terms of use).

